crystal","intro":"New shoes, new shirt, new hat — Ate Crystal here! Let's talk clothes, on and off the court.","items":[{"t":"damit","e":"clothes"},{"t":"kamiseta","e":"T-shirt"},{"t":"pantalon","e":"pants"},{"t":"sapatos","e":"shoes"},{"t":"sombrero","e":"hat"},{"t":"medyas","e":"socks"},{"t":"dyaket","e":"jacket"},{"t":"palda","e":"skirt"},{"t":"baro","e":"shirt"},{"t":"sinturon","e":"belt"},{"t":"bago","e":"new"},{"t":"luma","e":"old"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Bago ang sapatos ko.","e":"My shoes are new.","speaker":"ate-crystal"},{"t":"Suot ko ang kamiseta.","e":"I am wearing the T-shirt.","speaker":"jetjet"},{"t":"Gusto ko ang bago kong sombrero.","e":"I like my new hat.","speaker":"tito-bong"}]},{"name":"At Home","icon":"🏠","host":"lola-joli","intro":"Welcome to Lola Joli's house, apo! Kitchen, bedroom, window, door — let's learn your way around a Filipino home.","items":[{"t":"kuwarto","e":"room"},{"t":"hapag","e":"table"},{"t":"upuan","e":"chair"},{"t":"kama","e":"bed"},{"t":"bintana","e":"window"},{"t":"pinto","e":"door"},{"t":"bubong","e":"roof"},{"t":"kusina","e":"kitchen"},{"t":"lababo","e":"sink"},{"t":"ilaw","e":"light"},{"t":"kandado","e":"lock"},{"t":"gripo","e":"faucet"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Nasa kusina ang nanay ko.","e":"My mother is in the kitchen.","speaker":"jetjet"},{"t":"Sarado ang pinto.","e":"The door is closed.","speaker":"lola-joli"},{"t":"Bukas ang bintana.","e":"The window is open.","speaker":"tita-baby"}]},{"name":"Daily Routine","icon":"⏰","host":"tita-baby","intro":"Tita Baby runs a tight ship — wake up, shower, breakfast, work. Learn the routine and your day runs itself!","items":[{"t":"gising","e":"awake"},{"t":"tulog","e":"sleep"},{"t":"maligo","e":"to shower"},{"t":"bumihis","e":"to get dressed"},{"t":"kain","e":"eat"},{"t":"inom","e":"drink"},{"t":"trabaho","e":"work"},{"t":"eskwela","e":"school"},{"t":"pahinga","e":"rest"},{"t":"laba","e":"laundry"},{"t":"luto","e":"cook"},{"t":"linis","e":"clean"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Gumigising ako nang maaga.","e":"I wake up early.","speaker":"tita-baby"},{"t":"Kumakain ako ng almusal.","e":"I eat breakfast.","speaker":"jetjet"},{"t":"Pumapasok ako sa trabaho.","e":"I go to work.","speaker":"tito-bong"}]},{"name":"Weather","icon":"🌦️","host":"lola-joli","intro":"A beekeeper always watches the sky! Hot, rainy, sunny — Lola Joli will teach you to talk about the weather like a Filipino.","items":[{"t":"panahon","e":"weather"},{"t":"mainit","e":"hot"},{"t":"malamig","e":"cold"},{"t":"maaraw","e":"sunny"},{"t":"maulan","e":"rainy"},{"t":"ulan","e":"rain"},{"t":"araw","e":"sun"},{"t":"buwan","e":"moon"},{"t":"hangin","e":"wind"},{"t":"bagyo","e":"storm"},{"t":"kulog","e":"thunder"},{"t":"kidlat","e":"lightning"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Mainit ang panahon ngayon.","e":"The weather is hot today.","speaker":"lola-joli"},{"t":"Umuulan sa labas.","e":"It is raining outside.","speaker":"tito-bong"},{"t":"Maaraw ngayon.","e":"It is sunny today.","speaker":"jetjet"}]},{"name":"Nature","icon":"🌿","host":"jetjet","intro":"Sea, mountain, river, trees — Jetjet loves the outdoors! Let's learn the words for the world around us.","items":[{"t":"dagat","e":"sea"},{"t":"bundok","e":"mountain"},{"t":"ilog","e":"river"},{"t":"lawa","e":"lake"},{"t":"kagubatan","e":"forest"},{"t":"bulaklak","e":"flower"},{"t":"puno","e":"tree"},{"t":"ibon","e":"bird"},{"t":"hayop","e":"animal"},{"t":"langit","e":"sky"},{"t":"bituin","e":"star"},{"t":"buhangin","e":"sand"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Malaki ang puno.","e":"The tree is big.","speaker":"jetjet"},{"t":"Nasa dagat ang bangka.","e":"The boat is on the sea.","speaker":"tito-bong"},{"t":"Maganda ang bulaklak.","e":"The flower is beautiful.","speaker":"lola-joli"}]},{"name":"Feelings","icon":"😊","host":"ate-crystal","intro":"Happy, tired, nervous before a big match — Ate Crystal feels it all! Let's learn to say how you feel.","items":[{"t":"masaya","e":"happy"},{"t":"malungkot","e":"sad"},{"t":"galit","e":"angry"},{"t":"takot","e":"afraid"},{"t":"pagod","e":"tired"},{"t":"inaantok","e":"sleepy"},{"t":"sabik","e":"excited"},{"t":"tahimik","e":"quiet"},{"t":"maingay","e":"noisy"},{"t":"busog","e":"full"},{"t":"kinakabahan","e":"nervous"},{"t":"maganda ang araw","e":"the day is nice"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Masaya ako ngayon.","e":"I am happy today.","speaker":"ate-crystal"},{"t":"Pagod ako.","e":"I am tired.","speaker":"tito-bong"},{"t":"Takot ako sa kulog.","e":"I am afraid of thunder.","speaker":"jetjet"}]},{"name":"Health & Body","icon":"🤒","host":"tita-baby","intro":"Head, stomach, fever, cough — Tita Baby here with the sensible stuff. Let's hope you never need these words, but learn them anyway!","items":[{"t":"sakit","e":"sickness / pain"},{"t":"masakit","e":"painful"},{"t":"ulo","e":"head"},{"t":"tiyan","e":"stomach"},{"t":"ngipin","e":"tooth"},{"t":"doktor","e":"doctor"},{"t":"nars","e":"nurse"},{"t":"gamot","e":"medicine"},{"t":"sakit ng ulo","e":"headache"},{"t":"lagnat","e":"fever"},{"t":"ubo","e":"cough"},{"t":"sipon","e":"cold"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Masakit ang ulo ko.","e":"My head hurts.","speaker":"jetjet"},{"t":"Pupunta ako sa doktor.","e":"I am going to the doctor.","speaker":"tita-baby"},{"t":"May lagnat ako.","e":"I have a fever.","speaker":"ate-crystal"}]},{"name":"Work & School","icon":"💼","host":"ate-crystal","intro":"Office, exam, meeting, homework — Ate Crystal juggles school and tennis, so she knows this one by heart. Let's go!","items":[{"t":"opisina","e":"office"},{"t":"amo","e":"boss"},{"t":"empleyado","e":"employee"},{"t":"mag-aaral","e":"student"},{"t":"pagsusulit","e":"exam"},{"t":"aralin","e":"lesson"},{"t":"libro","e":"book"},{"t":"lapis","e":"pencil"},{"t":"papel","e":"paper"},{"t":"kompyuter","e":"computer"},{"t":"proyekto","e":"project"},{"t":"pulong","e":"meeting"}],"sentences":[{"t":"Nasa opisina ako.","e":"I am at the office.","speaker":"tito-bong"},{"t":"Nag-aaral ako ng Tagalog.","e":"I am studying Tagalog.","speaker":"lumpy"},{"t":"May pulong kami ngayon.","e":"We have a meeting t